# style options:
# 0 = full task bar with logo
# 1 = compact task bar
# 2 = floating task bar in upper left corner
# 3 = floating task bar in upper middle
# 4 = floating task bar in upper right corner
# 5 = floating task bar with left offset
# 6 = floating task bar with right offset

